{
  "gnu_commit": "45b0f7699df36b3849edc3bdef37d4cb9e75b9ea",
  "provenance": "Retained generated-support snapshot, not GNU Git blobs. SHA-256 values attest the existing bytes, not a reproduced generation. GNU generator/rule and input references below were traced at gnu_commit; original execution, toolchain and complete generation inputs are not recorded. In particular eucjp-ms uses an external glibc charmap. subdirs.el is build-aux/update-subdirs output for the pinned lisp/ directories in the C locale (the bytes crates/romacs-vm-gui/src/loadup.rs update_subdirs_writes_what_gnus_script_writes records); an earlier snapshot listed a local vendor directory the pin lacks, which GNU startup now reads once default-directory is per buffer. No claim is made that these retained outputs can be regenerated byte-for-byte from the pin alone.",
